Subject: [PATCH 16/23] docs : record wmma GEMM investigation, L1 measured as
 spent

Stage-elimination on mul_mat_fp8_wmma: fragment LDS chain ~free, scale pass
~13% (FMA-bound, irreducible), staging/barriers ~85%. aiter kpack/2-stage do
not port (lane-half fragment split, smem doubling). Found a new LLVM
miscompile: a 2-k-step fragment lookahead with register rotation folds the
copies and reuses step-0 operands (PPL 183142; caught only after fixing the
check - random fp8 data false-passes because NaN payloads make every element
comparison NaN). Documented the check template (/tmp/check_wmma.cu) and the
do-not-retry rule. Tree unchanged perf-wise.

Assisted-by: Claude Sonnet
